 "body": "These are the changes I proposed in https://github.com/arduino/Arduino/pull/6070\r\n\r\n- Separate into **Issues** and **Pull Requests** sections so that it is easy for the contributor to determine what they actually need to read.\r\n- Reformatting and rewrites for better readability\r\n- Incorporate a bit more of the content of https://github.com/arduino/Arduino/issues/3368, https://github.com/arduino/Arduino/pull/3337#issuecomment-113461444, and the [Development Policy wiki page](https://github.com/arduino/Arduino/wiki/Development-Policy).\r\n\r\nSince I made some significant changes, I broke it into multiple commits to make it easy to modify the PR if some of my edits are rejected. I am happy to squash this to a single commit before the merge.\r\n\r\nI welcome any feedback on my edits and am happy to make any changes requested.",
